# Fun Kids Activities this April Holidays

Looking for fun kids activities this April holidays? Alright kids...it has been way too long and this Easter we are back with drumming, singing and dancing @ The Palmwoods Girl Guide Hut on April 14th 10am-11am.  Bring your friends and get practicing your solos on mum and dads saucepans at home because this time we are going to give a prize for the most awesome solo. Extra singing and dancing are definitely encouraged!
